276
00:25:27,480 --> 00:25:28,840
Gum-Gum blah.

277
00:25:30,880 --> 00:25:32,840
Are you still, Straw Hat?

278
00:25:34,840 --> 00:25:36,020
Oh, yeah.

279
00:25:36,440 --> 00:25:37,460
That's me.

280
00:25:44,940 --> 00:25:46,820
Oh, Joy Boy.

281
00:25:47,500 --> 00:25:51,620
Joy Boy, how long it's been
since I've felt this rhythm.

282
00:25:52,600 --> 00:25:54,720
Can you hear me, Joy Boy?

283
00:25:56,820 --> 00:25:59,055
It feels as if you're right beside me.

284
00:25:59,360 --> 00:26:02,240
My heart is dancing with excitement.

285
00:26:04,020 --> 00:26:07,660
I cannot help but feel
that fate is at work.

286
00:26:07,960 --> 00:26:12,280
I cannot help but put my
faith in this young man!

287
00:26:12,700 --> 00:26:14,440
You wanna know who I am?

288
00:26:15,100 --> 00:26:16,940
Monkey D.

289
00:26:17,320 --> 00:26:23,180
Luffy, the man who surpasses you,
and then become King of the Pirates!
